WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.805 line:100%,end
Invoicing is visible only to
the workshop administrator.

00:00:03.805 --> 00:00:06.300 line:100%,end
Open Invoices from the menu.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:12.611 line:100%,end
First fill in Invoicing details: business ID, account number,
hourly rate and the workshop's own logo.

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:18.300 line:100%,end
The invoice number and the Finnish payment reference
are created automatically.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.402 line:100%,end
Press New invoice and choose the customer.

00:00:21.402 --> 00:00:26.100 line:100%,end
Tick one or more completed work orders.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.281 line:100%,end
The invoice language can be chosen from fourteen languages.

00:00:30.281 --> 00:00:33.200 line:100%,end
Then press Create draft invoice.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:38.169 line:100%,end
Hours worked and parts used
are already on the lines.

00:00:38.169 --> 00:00:44.700 line:100%,end
The part price comes from the part's price details.
Check the lines and press Save.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:51.299 line:100%,end
The preview shows the logo, the payment reference
and the bank's virtual barcode.

00:00:51.299 --> 00:00:55.700 line:100%,end
You can print the invoice or download it as a PDF.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:59.482 line:100%,end
Send the invoice to the customer by email.

00:00:59.482 --> 00:01:03.100 line:100%,end
A sent invoice is no longer edited.

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:06.680 line:100%,end
For an e-invoice, press Download Finvoice.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:12.000 line:100%,end
Send the file through your own bank
or accounting software.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.846 line:100%,end
When the payment has arrived, press Mark as paid.

00:01:15.846 --> 00:01:19.700 line:100%,end
A mistake is corrected with a credit note.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:24.989 line:100%,end
An invoiced work order shows
the link On invoice and the invoice number.

00:01:24.989 --> 00:01:28.600 line:100%,end
The same work cannot be invoiced twice.
